<< /A 42 0 R /Alt (Infographic titled \215Hallmarks of Cancer \205 2026 Update\216 showing four sections: nine acquired functional capabilities, four enabling phenotypic characteristics, hallmark-conveying microenvironment cells, and two systemic interactions related to cancer development and progression, with corresponding illustrations and brief explanations.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 26 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
